                              <L-1 L="EN">The referred CsmCallback is called when the crypto job has been finished.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Csm_00123</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
